# These are KAT vector files pinned by SHA-256 in the repo-root kats-manifest.toml. Git must not
# rewrite their bytes per-platform: with `core.autocrlf=true` a Windows clone would hold CRLF while
# the blob and CI hold LF, so a plain `sha256sum` would contradict the manifest on one platform and
# agree on the other. `-text` disables all conversion. Same reasoning, and same fix, as the
# `lib-q-saturnin/tests/fixtures/** -text` line in the repo-root .gitattributes -- kept local to
# this directory only because the card that added these files scoped edits to this crate.
* -text
